  In config.py: APP_SECRET_KEY: str = "dev-secret-change-in-production" — must be a random secret in prod.

  Result: 
  # python3 -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"                                                                                                                                                                                                       
# Then add to backend/.env:                                                                                                                                                                               
