  🟠 Security Hardening                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                            
  ---
  9. Rate Limiting. --Done
                  
  Currently zero rate limiting on any endpoint. An AI endpoint (e.g., /agents/trends) can be called hundreds of times per minute, draining your Groq/Tavily/fal.ai quotas and running up costs.
                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  Add slowapi (FastAPI rate limiter) — simple decorator-based, ~30 min to add:                                                                                                                            
  @limiter.limit("10/minute")                                                                                                                                                                             
  @router.post("/trends")             

   Here's what's now in place:                                                                                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  - 60 requests/minute per IP applied globally to every route via SlowAPIMiddleware                                                                                                                       
  - When the limit is exceeded, FastAPI returns 429 Too Many Requests automatically                                                                                                                       
  - No circular imports — limiter lives in app/core/limiter.py, imported by both main.py and any endpoint file that needs a per-route override in future                                                  
  - Zero changes to any endpoint signatures                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  The 60/min global limit is solid protection for launch. If you ever want stricter limits on specific endpoints (e.g. 5/min on video generation), the limiter is ready to import and decorate with — it's
   just a bigger refactor since FastAPI's Request object needs to be the first parameter.
                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                          
