  15. Uptime Monitoring
                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  Use Better Uptime (free) or UptimeRobot to ping /health every 5 min and alert you if backend goes down.   

  Recommended: UptimeRobot (free)                                                                                                                                                                         
   
  1. Go to https://uptimerobot.com and create a free account                                                                                                                                              
  2. Click "Add New Monitor"                                
  3. Fill in:                                                                                                                                                                                             
    - Monitor Type: HTTP(s)                                 
    - Friendly Name: Contiq API                                                                                                                                                                           
    - URL: https://api.contiq.app/health (your production backend URL)                                                                                                                                    
    - Monitoring Interval: 5 minutes                                                                                                                                                                      
  4. Add your email for alerts — you'll get notified immediately if the backend goes down                                                                                                                 
  5. Optionally add a second monitor for the frontend: https://contiq.app                                                                                                                                 
                                                            
  That's it. The /health endpoint already exists in your backend:                                                                                                                                         
  @app.get("/health")                                       
  async def health_check():                                                                                                                                                                               
      return {"status": "ok", "version": "0.1.0"}           

  ---                                                                                                                                                                                                     
  This is a "set it when you deploy" step — UptimeRobot needs your real production URL, so come back to it once the domain and hosting are set up.
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
                                                                                                                                                                                                          
